# Verify before done

After non-trivial code changes in this repo:

1. Follow `.cursor/skills/verify-and-fix/SKILL.md`.
2. Run scoped checks from `docs/agent-kb/verification.md` (frontend `tsc`, backend `manage.py check`, relevant pytest/Jest).
3. Launch Bugbot on the diff; add Security Review for auth/payments/admin/sync/uploads.
4. **Main agent fixes** blocking findings (compile errors, failed tests, Critical/High). Review subagents stay readonly.
5. Do not say the task is done until checks pass or remaining blockers are reported to the user.
6. If application or docs/agent files changed, append a dated entry to `docs/tracker.md` before claiming done (or update the commit hash when the user asks to commit).

Max 3 verify→fix loops. Docs-only or explicit “review only” requests skip the fix loop; still update `docs/tracker.md` when docs/agent packs change.
